    init                create encrypted vault
    tui                 interactive terminal menu
    list                list saved identities
    add                 add email and website login record
    accounts            list saved platform accounts and explicitly cached
                        session observations
    close-sessions      close isolated browsers; preserve sessions without
                        signing out
    set-identifier      correct expected signup identity without discarding
                        the browser profile; invalidates prior observations
    add-existing        save an existing platform identity
    signup              start user-completed consumer signup in an isolated
                        browser
    signin              signin the selected isolated platform session
    switch              switch the selected isolated platform session
    resume              resume the selected isolated platform session
    verify              fresh browser navigation and identity observation
    signout             signout the selected isolated platform session
    verify-signout      check that fresh mail navigation requires
                        authentication
    remove              remove local record/profile, not the external account
    close               close the selected isolated platform session
    backup              create a verified encrypted backup
    restore             restore a verified encrypted backup
    generate            generate address candidates, not mailboxes
    show                show record
    copy                copy email
    copy-password       copy saved password
    open                open sign-in page
    delete              delete record

